  "confidence": "manual found",
  "notes": "DMX chart taken from Betopper's own grandMA2 XML profile (betopper_lb150_12ch.xml) on the product page; the PDF manual (406-15012-002F) is image-only so its text could not be extracted, and manuals.plus blocks fetches. Betopper specs say 'colour wheel: 11 colours + white' and 'static gobo wheel: 11 gobos + white circle', but the XML profile enumerates 11 colours (5-step ranges 11-65) and 13 gobos (11-75); the XML does not name the colours, so the colour list here is only white + color1..color11 (order unknown, color_names_guess). CONFLICTS with the repo's guessed 12ch map: repo has ch8 ColorWheel with 9 colours in 10-value steps -- actual is 12 slots (white 0-10, then 5-value steps), and 66-191 is also white; repo ch11 'Focus' is actually a reserved/no-function channel (no focus on this fixture); repo ch12 Reset actually carries PWM frequency + dimmer-curve settings, with reset all at 151-160. Pan/tilt/speed/dimmer/strobe/gobo/prism positions (ch1-7, 9, 10) agree with the repo. Dimensions 236x174x329 mm are given by Betopper without stating which axis is which (width/length assumed). The same OEM chassis is sold as U'King ZQ02341 (see uking-zq02341.json), but the U'King 12ch chart is DIFFERENT (strobe/dimmer order, colour ranges), so do not assume the two are DMX-identical. Related repo GDTF: UKing@ZQ02341_150W_Big_Steel_Gun_LED_Moving_Head_Beam."
